            "question": "How long does it last?",
            "answer": "<p>6 to 8 hours on skin, longer on fabric. It is an extrait-strength eau de parfum.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I return an opened bottle?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, within 30 days. Scent is personal.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is it unisex?",
            "answer": "<p>Everything we make is. No. 04 skews soft; No. 03 skews smoky.</p>"
          }
